{"4127870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gamers Club Repeat", "steam_appid": 4127870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uha was one of those who got hit by an asteroid incident and was hospitalized for years. And now when he wokes up there's an unfamiliar woman besides him sleeping right next to him!? What's this self proclaimed older sister gonna do to him. His friends were now in university and one is a working student and because of the asteroid incident he got left behind in many things, a school repeater and a gamer continue his lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127870/extras/a424bca3347c310a76f6fe1ced817c37.avif?t=1784136478\" width=421 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127870/extras/07afa5bcb51d6c39c5c7e2eed068ce94.webp?t=1784136478\" width=422 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose between event mode or normal mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127870/extras/050f1391e754111bfefd1c8c85b3559f.poster.avif?t=1784136478\" width=654 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127870/extras/050f1391e754111bfefd1c8c85b3559f.webm?t=1784136478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127870/extras/050f1391e754111bfefd1c8c85b3559f.mp4?t=1784136478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Armors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different types of equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could sleep for 8hrs, choose between day or night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series like story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At starter map you can do things like grinding levels, obtaining rare equipment by completing the given quest. Collect coins at the battle arena. You can unlock new character if conditions met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the game by defeating the players at the arena and get the rare equipments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 10-24 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Adventure, Slice of Life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforms: Windows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uha was one of those who got hit by an asteroid incident and was hospitalized for years. And now when he wokes up there's an unfamiliar woman besides him sleeping right next to him!? What's this self proclaimed older sister gonna do to him. His friends were now in university and one is a working student and because of the asteroid incident he got left behind in many things, a school repeater and a gamer continue his lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127870/extras/a424bca3347c310a76f6fe1ced817c37.avif?t=1784136478\" width=421 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><im